  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GRANT FOR THE NATIONAL GALLERY OF ZIMBABWEFOR INTERNATIONAL WOMEN&apos;S DAY</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The festival programme includes master classes in virtual reality and film making, industry showcasing and networking events, including a Women World&#x2019;s Showcase bringing together women leaders in virtual reality and animation. The main partner implementing the Film Festival is Matamba Film Labs.  Matamba film labs is a New media organisation which is registered and based in Zimbabwe which produces virtual reality, and animation content and places a specific focus on supporting women&#x2019;s leadership in the tech and virtual reality industry and providing safe, non-exploitative environments for women to learn new media storytelling and building the skills and confidence of local women filmmakers.</narrative>
  </description>
